  <h2>2. Nature of the content</h2>
  <p>
    DaoismHub is an English-language educational reference about Chinese contemplative
    traditions — Daoism, Chan Buddhism and related self-cultivation — their texts, history,
    concepts, practices, modern research and anonymized practitioner experience. All content
    is editorial and educational in nature. Nothing on these sites constitutes medical,
    psychological, legal, financial or other professional advice; see the
    <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

